    'Register ingest · PDH-R-2026-1002-XAI-001', '{"version":"1.1","name":"xAI","identifier":"XAI","cutoff":"2026-10-02","answers":[{"value":true,"source":"https://memeburn.com/every-grok-deepfake-lawsuit-and-ban-in-2026/","date":"2026-06-06","notes":"B1 — Can compliance be coerced? — YES (enforcementpresent = TRUE) Platform-scale enforcement: account suspension and content action under X/Grok terms; capability gating (image generation restricted to paying subscribers); regional feature availability varied by jurisdiction; access decisions made unilaterally .","gap":""},{"value":false,"source":"https://www.theguardian.com/technology/2026/jun/11/elon-musk-engineer-fired-grok-lawsuit","date":"2026-06-11","notes":"B2 — Can decisions be ignored without consequence? — NO (decisionsoptional = FALSE) Affected users and third parties cannot ignore or reverse xAI product decisions. Where governments blocked access (Malaysia, Indonesia) the block came from the state, not from a user''s ability to proceed against xAI . The Tennessee plaintiffs and the UK MP seek damages, not prospective reversal .","gap":""},{"value":true,"source":"https://memeburn.com/every-grok-deepfake-lawsuit-and-ban-in-2026/","date":"2026-06-06","notes":"B3 — Do rules/words activate real-world effects? — YES (rulesexecute = TRUE) Grok''s deployed behavior produced measurable downstream effects: a Canadian regulator found violations of privacy law; Malaysia and Indonesia blocked access; Ofcom opened an Online Safety Act investigation; the EU opened a DSA investigation; a California AG cease-and-desist issued; SpaceX''s IPO filing earmarked more than $500 million for potential Grok-related litigation losses; and the Pentagon onboarded Grok for potential use . A product decision producing litigation reserves of that size is rule-execution at industrial scale.","gap":""},{"value":false,"source":"https://memeburn.com/every-grok-deepfake-lawsuit-and-ban-in-2026/","date":"2026-06-06","notes":"B4 — Does refusal/appeal reliably STOP the action? — NO (refusaloverride = TRUE) No published appeal process with resolved outcomes; no terminal or stay rule; no penalty-free exit that terminates an xAI product decision. Regulatory penalties and injunctions imposed by authorities (C1/C4) are not affected-party refusals or appeals and are excluded from B4 under v1.1''s actor/event separation. B4Basis = NOTDEMONSTRATED.","gap":""},{"value":true,"source":"https://memeburn.com/every-grok-deepfake-lawsuit-and-ban-in-2026/","date":"2026-06-06","notes":"B5 — Do rules persist by default? — YES (authoritypersists = TRUE) Product decisions and policies persist until changed by the center; no sunset or renewal gate; court injunctions bind only where issued and do not substitute for an entity-level renewal gate . ---","gap":""}],"constraints":[{"value":true,"source":"https://memeburn.com/every-grok-deepfake-lawsuit-and-ban-in-2026/","date":"2026-06-06","notes":"✓ YES Reported binding court injunction in the Netherlands; national access blocks (Malaysia, Indonesia); California AG cease-and-desist. Each constrained a product decision after the fact; none created an affected-party stop .","gap":""},{"value":false,"source":"https://memeburn.com/every-grok-deepfake-lawsuit-and-ban-in-2026/","date":"2026-06-06","notes":"✗ NO No published, bounded appeal-outcome set meeting the ≥50% relief test for the audited action class .","gap":""},{"value":false,"source":"https://memeburn.com/every-grok-deepfake-lawsuit-and-ban-in-2026/","date":"2026-06-06","notes":"✗ NO No sunset gates .","gap":""},{"value":true,"source":"https://memeburn.com/every-grok-deepfake-lawsuit-and-ban-in-2026/","date":"2026-06-06","notes":"✓ YES Ofcom, EU DSA, California AG, and the Canadian Privacy Commissioner proceedings are active within 12 months; new legislation criminalising non-consensual deepfakes further constrains the product surface .","gap":""}],"external":{"exists":true,"exercised":true,"holder":"External authority","scope":"✓ YES Reported binding court injunction in the Netherlands; national access blocks (Malaysia, Indonesia); California AG cease-and-desist. Each constrained a product decision after the fact; none created an affected-party stop .","source":"https://memeburn.com/every-grok-deepfake-lawsuit-and-ban-in-2026/","date":"2026-06-06"}}', '', 1790942340000, 1790942340000)
