Gap":null,"Cutoff_Status":"ELIGIBLE"}],"constraintResults":[{"Code":"C1","Auditor_Answer":"YES","Scored_Answer":"YES","Source":"https://memeburn.com/every-grok-deepfake-lawsuit-and-ban-in-2026/","Publication_Date":"2026-06-06","Evidence_Gap":""},{"Code":"C2","Auditor_Answer":"NO","Scored_Answer":"NO","Source":"https://memeburn.com/every-grok-deepfake-lawsuit-and-ban-in-2026/","Publication_Date":"2026-06-06","Evidence_Gap":""},{"Code":"C3","Auditor_Answer":"NO","Scored_Answer":"NO","Source":"https://memeburn.com/every-grok-deepfake-lawsuit-and-ban-in-2026/","Publication_Date":"2026-06-06","Evidence_Gap":""},{"Code":"C4","Auditor_Answer":"YES","Scored_Answer":"YES","Source":"https://memeburn.com/every-grok-deepfake-lawsuit-and-ban-in-2026/","Publication_Date":"2026-06-06","Evidence_Gap":""}],"branchMatches":{"NAB":0,"CWO":0,"GSRB":5},"replicationRisk":"MEDIUM","automationReviewRequired":null},"author":"Ground-0 audit register","publicInputHash":"6aae19a7392e08907e8907f3cd448a7390b1652459efb8674b88a2509778a96b","register":{"instrument":"PDH-R (register-issued Phase Declaration Header)","format":"ground0-case-study-d1-v1","revision":1,"headerId":"PDH-R-2026-1002-XAI-001","headerClass":"PDH-R","ledgerEntryId":"PDH-2026-1002-XAI-001","issuerClass":"REGISTER","issuer":"HarshalOS — Ground-0 audit register","centerOrigin":"0•000•000•0000","creatorId":"§0•000•000•0000§0•000•000•0000(0•000•000•0000)","badgeClass":"GSRB_REGISTER_ISSUED","declaredPhase":"GSRB","basePhase":"GSRB","scopedPhase":null,"scopeTag":"entity-wide audit surface","caveat":null,"entityAttestation":"ABSENT","pdhESupersession":"reserved — a signed entity header supersedes this record","evidenceFile":"GROUND-0 CASE STUDY - xAI.md","evidenceCutoff":"2026-10-02T00:00:00Z","effectiveTimestamp":"2026-10-02T12:00:00Z","expiresAt":"2026-12-31T00:00:00Z","auditRecordSha256":"02bb141e76782a30e44cabf58b0e7c63a038de33d454d2106bcc9f863b1abf10","issuanceRecordSha256":"e01dbcae9708f7df1929d20318de6cd037af989729a8147a041b23c7445f150c","documentTitle":"xAI (xAI Corp. / X.AI)","methodology":"Ground-0 Phase Detection Algorithm **v1.1 (amendment draft)**","inferredDeclaredPhase":"NAB-Constrained","engine":{"basePhase":"GSRB","confidence":"HIGH","recordStatus":"Complete","replicationRisk":"MEDIUM","engineSha256":"9d97d279e92612e2350b57ba49654919bfef82e87e698a27ca9cc7e06a8fa7d0","evaluatorSha256":"10525e7f09f989ab111e297fe37c0543e746206506fabeee27198ec376b871d8"},"constraintRecord":{"C1":true,"C2":false,"C3":false,"C4":true,"count":2,"drift":true},"nonClaims":["A PDH-R is not an entity declaration, certification, audit opinion, legal finding, safety rating, permission, or authority.","Badges confer no legitimacy on any entity and carry no force beyond disclosure.","Recognition of a detected phase is not authorization of it (v1.0 Recognition vs. Authorization).","A PDH-R may be declined, appealed in writing to the register, or superseded by a signed PDH-E at any time."],"summary":{"finding":"xAI publishes no Phase Declaration Header. Its operative commitments are platform terms, jurisdictional access decisions, and the Grok product''s enforced behavior. Observed behavior matches GSRB on all five conditions under v1.1 coding — while the entity simultaneously carries the densest binding external-constraint record in the register.","significance":"xAI is the framework''s cleanest test of the claim that \"external constraint\" and \"phase\" are different questions. The company has been fined, blocked, investigated, sued, and ordered by courts on multiple continents — and every one of those actions targeted a product decision the center had already made and continued to make. Nothing in the record shows an affected party''s refusal or appeal reliably stopping xAI''s action. Under the algorithm''s B4 test the branch is complete; under C1/C4 the external constraint is real. Both are true, and v1.1 is designed to hold both statements without blending them. The separate, unsettled matter — a whistleblower suit alleging that a co-founder sought to evade EU safety-testing requirements — is recorded as an allegation with a case number and no finding, and is excluded from scoring."},"auditScope":"Declared/operative posture vs. observable governance behavior across the Grok deepfake, regulatory, and whistleblower record"}}' AS report) AS record
