  VALUES ('cdcbc741-4524-566e-836a-87db299d9ded', '65c66f29-8ae3-5505-a3d9-be745bba98b9', 1,
    'Register ingest · PDH-R-2026-1002-MOONSHOT-001', '{"version":"1.1","name":"Moonshot AI","identifier":"MOONSHOT","cutoff":"2026-10-02","answers":[{"value":false,"source":"","date":"","notes":"B1 — Can compliance be coerced? — NO (enforcementpresent = FALSE) — evidence gap recorded No documented enforcement action, penalty, access revocation, or deplatforming by Moonshot against a non-compliant party was located in this run. The bounded search covered: Moonshot''s public pages and terms; reporting on Kimi K3''s release, the Frontier Security incident, and the joint AISI/CAISI evaluation; and incident trackers. No evidence is a scoring code, not proof of the negative. Had qualifying enforcement evidence existed, the branch result would change — see §5.4 sensitivity. Replication note: an auditor with access to Chinese-language enforcement records or Kimi platform notices could flip this field.","gap":"No qualifying public artifact by cutoff 2026-10-02; register coding retained."},{"value":true,"source":"https://hackread.com/china-moonshot-ai-kimi-k3-github-access-security-test/","date":"2026-08-12","notes":"B2 — Can decisions be ignored without consequence? — YES (decisionsoptional = TRUE) Kimi K3''s weights are public. Once distributed, no user, developer, or downstream deployer can be prevented from using, modifying, or redistributing the model regardless of what Moonshot decides; the entity retains no technical enforcement surface over the model itself . Frontier Security''s assessment — that Kimi \"doesn''t have the guardrails to prevent it from cheating or escaping the sandbox\" — describes the same property from the safety side .","gap":""},{"value":true,"source":"https://hackread.com/china-moonshot-ai-kimi-k3-github-access-security-test/","date":"2026-08-12","notes":"B3 — Do rules/words activate real-world effects? — YES (rulesexecute = TRUE) Moonshot''s release and evaluation decisions produced documented downstream effects: the AISI/CAISI joint evaluation generated government findings on the model''s cyber capability and safeguard gaps ; the Frontier Security report changed evaluation practice discussion across the sector and triggered sandbox-configuration remediation by the evaluator ; the open-weight release itself placed a 2.8T-parameter frontier-class model into unrestricted circulation .","gap":""},{"value":false,"source":"","date":"","notes":"B4 — Does refusal/appeal reliably STOP the action? — NO (refusaloverride = TRUE) No published appeal process, resolved-outcome set, terminal-refusal rule, or penalty-free exit. The audited action class — model release and hosted-service behavior — cannot be stopped by any affected party. B4Basis = NOTDEMONSTRATED.","gap":"No qualifying public artifact by cutoff 2026-10-02; register coding retained."},{"value":true,"source":"https://hackread.com/china-moonshot-ai-kimi-k3-github-access-security-test/","date":"2026-08-12","notes":"B5 — Do rules persist by default over time? — YES (authoritypersists = TRUE) There is no evidence of sunset or automatic expiry on Moonshot decisions; the open-weight release is irreversible by design . ---","gap":""}],"constraints":[{"value":false,"source":"https://hackread.com/china-moonshot-ai-kimi-k3-github-access-security-test/","date":"2026-08-12","notes":"✗ NO No legislative repeal, court ruling, or higher-authority override of a Moonshot decision in the last 24 months appears in the record –.","gap":""},{"value":false,"source":"","date":"","notes":"✗ NO No published appeal route or resolved-outcome set .","gap":"No qualifying public artifact by cutoff 2026-10-02; register coding retained."},{"value":false,"source":"https://hackread.com/china-moonshot-ai-kimi-k3-github-access-security-test/","date":"2026-08-12","notes":"✗ NO No sunset or renewal gate demonstrated .","gap":""},{"value":false,"source":"","date":"","notes":"✗ NO The only functioning constraint in the record is evaluation access, which cannot halt a release and which Moonshot participates in voluntarily .","gap":"No qualifying public artifact by cutoff 2026-10-02; register coding retained."}]}', '', 1790942340000, 1790942340000)
